flowchart LR
    T[Triage] -->|owner bot has questions| NI[Needs Input]
    NI -->|human answers| T
    T -->|brief written| B[Backlog]
    B[Backlog] -->|assigned to the swarm,<br/>draft PR opened| AC[Active<br/><i>issue card stays here</i>]
    AC -.->|PR card starts here| IP[In Progress<br/><i>PR is a draft</i>]
    IP -->|coordinator pre-check passes<br/>PR marked ready| AR[Auto Review<br/><i>automated reviewer runs</i>]
    AR -->|P1 or P2 finding<br/>PR back to draft| IP
    AR -->|blocked on another change| P[Pending]
    P -->|blocker cleared,<br/>main merged in| AR
    AR -->|clean + post-check +<br/>deployed and verified on staging,<br/>screenshots in PR| HR[Human Review]
    HR -->|human requests changes<br/>or late finding| IP
    HR -->|human merges to main| D[Done]
